WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.688 --> 00:00:13.829
hurried out of Mara's house.

2
00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:17.870
"Listen, guys," she said.

3
00:00:17.890 --> 00:00:22.952
"I have to—" "Practice throwing a Frisbee?"

4
00:00:23.233 --> 00:00:23.853
said Terrell.

5
00:00:26.154 --> 00:00:27.814
He tossed the Frisbee to Roxy again.

6
00:00:31.468 --> 00:00:34.550
"Ha-ha!" Roxy pretended to laugh as the Frisbee dropped onto the grass.

7
00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:37.712
"First I have to run home," she said.

8
00:00:37.732 --> 00:00:41.595
"I forgot to, um, feed my goldfish!"

9
00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:52.302
A minute later Roxy was soaring over downtown Metro City.

10
00:00:53.643 --> 00:00:56.105
West Street was filled with smashed cars and buses.

11
00:00:58.086 --> 00:01:00.148
Roxy saw enormous footprints in the street.

12
00:01:01.836 --> 00:01:03.277
They pointed in every direction.

13
00:01:03.297 --> 00:01:10.540
"It looks like a giant lizard made those footprints," thought Roxy.

14
00:01:11.820 --> 00:01:14.161
Detective Smith stood near a huge pile of bricks.

15
00:01:15.062 --> 00:01:16.582
There was a broken sign in the pile.

16
00:01:17.363 --> 00:01:18.743
The sign read "Quick Mart."

17
00:01:22.545 --> 00:01:23.305
Roxy smiled.

18
00:01:23.926 --> 00:01:26.347
"Why did you knock down Quick Mart, Detective?

19
00:01:27.007 --> 00:01:28.147
Were they out of coffee?"

20
00:01:29.876 --> 00:01:32.057
"Very funny, Rocket Girl."

21
00:01:32.317 --> 00:01:33.438
Detective Smith frowned.

22
00:01:33.458 --> 00:01:36.399
"I didn't knock down Quick Mart.

23
00:01:37.219 --> 00:01:39.140
A huge monster stepped on it."

24
00:01:40.521 --> 00:01:41.501
Roxy looked around.

25
00:01:41.521 --> 00:01:44.643
"I see the monster's footprints.

26
00:01:45.643 --> 00:01:47.204
But where is the monster now?"

27
00:01:48.384 --> 00:01:49.365
The detective shrugged.

28
00:01:49.385 --> 00:01:51.365
"I just got here.

29
00:01:52.326 --> 00:01:54.567
The monster was already gone when I arrived."

30
00:01:56.107 --> 00:01:56.968
A woman ran over.

31
00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:00.641
"The monster went south."

32
00:02:01.421 --> 00:02:02.501
She pointed down the street.

33
00:02:03.262 --> 00:02:05.343
Then she looked across the street and sighed.

34
00:02:05.963 --> 00:02:08.444
"I'm a gardener.

35
00:02:09.384 --> 00:02:11.185
I was here to weed the public garden.

36
00:02:11.785 --> 00:02:12.906
But it's ruined."

37
00:02:12.926 --> 00:02:14.967
"And so is my car!"

38
00:02:15.207 --> 00:02:16.087
said an angry man.

39
00:02:16.987 --> 00:02:19.348
He was walking over to Detective Smith and Roxy.

40
00:02:21.049 --> 00:02:22.430
"The monster stepped on it!"

41
00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:26.831
"The monster stepped on my bus!"

42
00:02:27.112 --> 00:02:27.852
said a bus driver.

43
00:02:29.076 --> 00:02:30.097
Another man ran over.

44
00:02:30.117 --> 00:02:32.698
"This is an outrage!

45
00:02:33.339 --> 00:02:36.120
That monster tore the roof off my flower store.

46
00:02:37.121 --> 00:02:38.661
Then it ate all my flowers!"

47
00:02:40.242 --> 00:02:42.103
"The monster ate the flowers?"

48
00:02:42.524 --> 00:02:43.484
asked Detective Smith.

49
00:02:44.705 --> 00:02:46.506
He took out his notepad and started writing.

50
00:02:47.706 --> 00:02:48.607
The gardener blinked.

51
00:02:48.627 --> 00:02:52.629
"I saw the monster eat all the flowers in the garden too!"

52
00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:55.551
The man from the flower store was still angry.

53
00:02:56.831 --> 00:02:57.692
He looked at Roxy.

54
00:02:58.252 --> 00:03:00.553
"What are you going to do about this, Rocket Girl?"

55
00:03:01.513 --> 00:03:02.714
Roxy held up her hands.

56
00:03:02.734 --> 00:03:07.316
"Relax. I will find the monster and stop it."

57
00:03:08.056 --> 00:03:09.036
She looked at the gardener.

58
00:03:10.217 --> 00:03:12.458
"You said the monster went south, right?"

59
00:03:12.478 --> 00:03:14.979
"Yes," said the gardener.

60
00:03:14.999 --> 00:03:18.220
"That's where the Metro City Convention Center is.

61
00:03:19.181 --> 00:03:23.282
I was actually going to go there later today because—" She gulped.

62
00:03:23.302 --> 00:03:25.983
"What's wrong?"

63
00:03:26.324 --> 00:03:26.944
asked Roxy.

64
00:03:28.004 --> 00:03:31.968
"I know why the monster went toward the convention center," said the gardener.

65
00:03:31.988 --> 00:03:35.811
"There's a huge flower show today!"
